{
  "title": { "zh": "分配律", "en": "Distribution" },
  "builds": "dist",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "「下雨，或者又刮风又地湿」和「下雨或刮风，并且下雨或地湿」是一回事：「或者」分配到「并且」上，就像乘法分配到加法上。「并且」在右边、在左边各一对，共四个方向。",
        "en": "“It rains, or it is windy and wet” and “it rains or is windy, and it rains or is wet” say the same: “or” distributes over “and”, as multiplication does over addition. With the “and” on the right and on the left, that makes two pairs, four directions."
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "c-dist_1",
      "kind": "proof",
      "step": { "zh": "分到右边", "en": "Out over the right" },
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "A ∨ (B ∧ C)" }, "goal": "(A ∨ B) ∧ (A ∨ C)" }],
      "cases": [{ "A": "Rain", "B": "Wind", "C": "Wet" }, { "A": "Sat", "B": "Rest", "C": "Happy" }],
      "hint": [{ "zh": "已知是一句「或者」。", "en": "The given is an “or”." }],
      "solution": [
        "e = orE(p, left: c1, right: c2) {",
        "  left {",
        "    i1 = orI[other=B, side=right](e.left)",
        "    i2 = orI[other=C, side=right](e.left)",
        "    c1 = andI(i1, i2)",
        "  }",
        "  right {",
        "    s = andE(e.right)",
        "    j1 = orI[other=A, side=left](s.left)",
        "    j2 = orI[other=A, side=left](s.right)",
        "    c2 = andI(j1, j2)",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "goal <- e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-dist_2",
      "kind": "proof",
      "step": { "zh": "合回来", "en": "Back together" },
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "(A ∨ B) ∧ (A ∨ C)" }, "goal": "A ∨ (B ∧ C)" }],
      "cases": [{ "A": "Rain", "B": "Wind", "C": "Wet" }, { "A": "Sat", "B": "Rest", "C": "Happy" }],
      "hint": [
        { "zh": "拆开「并且」，得到两句「或者」。", "en": "Split the “and” into its two “or”s." },
        {
          "zh": "两句「或者」先后分情况。只有两句都不给出「下雨」时，才要「刮风 ∧ 地湿」。",
          "en": "Take cases on the two “or”s in turn. Only when neither gives “it rains” is “it is windy ∧ the ground is wet” needed."
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "s = andE(p)",
        "o1 = orE(s.left, left: i1, right: o2) {",
        "  left {",
        "    i1 = orI[other=\"B & C\", side=right](o1.left)",
        "  }",
        "  right {",
        "    o2 = orE(s.right, left: i2, right: i3) {",
        "      left {",
        "        i2 = orI[other=\"B & C\", side=right](o2.left)",
        "      }",
        "      right {",
        "        c = andI(o1.right, o2.right)",
        "        i3 = orI[other=A, side=left](c)",
        "      }",
        "    }",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "goal <- o1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-dist_3",
      "kind": "proof",
      "step": { "zh": "分到左边", "en": "Out over the left" },
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "(A ∧ B) ∨ C" }, "goal": "(A ∨ C) ∧ (B ∨ C)" }],
      "cases": [{ "A": "Rain", "B": "Wind", "C": "Wet" }, { "A": "Sat", "B": "Rest", "C": "Happy" }],
      "hint": [{ "zh": "和第一段一样，只是左右换了。", "en": "As in the first task, left and right swapped." }],
      "solution": [
        "e = orE(p, left: c1, right: c2) {",
        "  left {",
        "    s = andE(e.left)",
        "    i1 = orI[other=C, side=right](s.left)",
        "    i2 = orI[other=C, side=right](s.right)",
        "    c1 = andI(i1, i2)",
        "  }",
        "  right {",
        "    j1 = orI[other=A, side=left](e.right)",
        "    j2 = orI[other=B, side=left](e.right)",
        "    c2 = andI(j1, j2)",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "goal <- e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-dist_4",
      "kind": "proof",
      "step": { "zh": "合回来（左边）", "en": "Back together, on the left" },
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "(A ∨ C) ∧ (B ∨ C)" }, "goal": "(A ∧ B) ∨ C" }],
      "cases": [{ "A": "Rain", "B": "Wind", "C": "Wet" }, { "A": "Sat", "B": "Rest", "C": "Happy" }],
      "hint": [{ "zh": "和第二段一样，只是左右换了。", "en": "As in the second task, left and right swapped." }],
      "solution": [
        "s = andE(p)",
        "o1 = orE(s.left, left: o2, right: i3) {",
        "  left {",
        "    o2 = orE(s.right, left: i1, right: i2) {",
        "      left {",
        "        c = andI(o1.left, o2.left)",
        "        i1 = orI[other=C, side=right](c)",
        "      }",
        "      right {",
        "        i2 = orI[other=\"A & B\", side=left](o2.right)",
        "      }",
        "    }",
        "  }",
        "  right {",
        "    i3 = orI[other=\"A & B\", side=left](o1.right)",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "goal <- o1"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
